{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1164ad91-c9ab-8b13-9c43-f9c53bc68fb5",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T15:26:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosemarie B. Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:24:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, how can I help you this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:24:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I am calling to ask about the skating area. Is it open right now? The one by the beach park."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:24:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The skating area, okay. Are you thinking of the outdoor ice or the rink? I want to make sure I point you right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:24:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Outdoor. The [line breaks up] the pond, I think, near the park. I do not know what you call it. I only want to know if people may skate there today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:24:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out a bit there. You said near the beach park? Ice depends on the weather, and we've had these swings in temperature, so I'd say don't count on it being open. Let me check what we have posted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. I can wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks. [pause] Alright, I'm back. Right now it's listed as closed, the ice isn't cleared for use. It gets posted when it's safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:25:12-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Closed. Okay. That is what I thought, but I wanted to be sure. My daughter's son, his teacher sends a weekly email, with the little emoji pictures, snowflakes and skates, and this week it says maybe a skating trip on Friday. So I am checking for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:25:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's sweet. Well, for Friday I wouldn't plan on it, but things can change."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:25:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. So if this answer does not work out, if it stays closed, what should I do? Who do I call? Is there another place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. If it's still closed, call back here in the morning and we can tell you what's posted, and we can see about indoor skating options as an alternative. Or you can leave me a number and I'll have someone call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:25:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...the number, yes. It is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:26:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-six. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:26:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rosemarie Ricci. R-I-C-C-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:26:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Rosemarie. I'll put a note in for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:26:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That is all I needed. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:26:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, have a good afternoon. Bye now."
    }
  ],
